{"id":"aba681acbc8d8ca7","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Covering Number","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number — ZFC Pcf2 Covering Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number — ZFC Pcf2 Covering Number","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number — ZFC Pcf2 Covering Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma,\\chi \\in V\">\\(\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma,\\chi \\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> is the one-place predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CoveringNumber}_S \\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CoveringNumber}_S \\subseteq V^5\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。 非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\">\\(\\min C\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\">\\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}covering\\text{-}number}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CoveringNumber}_S(\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma,\\chi)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\bigwedge_{\\xi\\in\\{\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma,\\chi\\}}\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\xi)\\land 2\\leq\\sigma\\leq\\theta\\leq\\mu\\leq\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\chi=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal P|:\\mathcal P\\subseteq[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\mu}\\land\\forall X\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\theta}\\;\\exists\\mathcal Q\\in[\\mathcal P]^{&lt;\\sigma}\\;(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal Q)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}covering\\text{-}number}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CoveringNumber}_S(\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma,\\chi)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\bigwedge_{\\xi\\in\\{\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma,\\chi\\}}\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\xi)\\land 2\\leq\\sigma\\leq\\theta\\leq\\mu\\leq\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\chi=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal P|:\\mathcal P\\subseteq[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\mu}\\land\\forall X\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\theta}\\;\\exists\\mathcal Q\\in[\\mathcal P]^{&lt;\\sigma}\\;(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal Q)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该值是标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cov}(\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{cov}(\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma)\\)</span>：用少于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 个、各自大小少于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 的成员覆盖每个大小少于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 的子集。</li>\n<li>参数次序保证候选覆盖族存在，因而最小基数有定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ is the one-place predicate from [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。 非空序数集合 $C$ 的 $\\min C$ 是满足 $m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)$ 的唯一 $m$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma,\\chi \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CoveringNumber}_S \\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\min C","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}covering\\text{-}number}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CoveringNumber}_S(\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma,\\chi)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\bigwedge_{\\xi\\in\\{\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma,\\chi\\}}\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\xi)\\land 2\\leq\\sigma\\leq\\theta\\leq\\mu\\leq\\lambda\\\\\n&\\land\\chi=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal P|:\\mathcal P\\subseteq[\\lambda]^{<\\mu}\\land\\forall X\\in[\\lambda]^{<\\theta}\\;\\exists\\mathcal Q\\in[\\mathcal P]^{<\\sigma}\\;(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal Q)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cov}(\\lambda,\\mu,\\theta,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":1770,"backlinks":[{"id":"8b42aabf4b81e034","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CoveringNumber}_S\\subseteq V^5$（见 [[58-df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3041","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number.md|58-df-zfc-pcf2-covering-number]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590","5582a281f15a33c2"]}